  "review_note": "FO-03 partial successor: typed deployment-attested node readiness and Ready/Active admission through owned complete inventory and authenticated exact-boot inspection. Current capacity authorization checks the exact epoch/boot and journal; raw Active state and historical acceptance grant no quantified reservation. Seven new capacity cases pass, along with 103 enrollment, 16 directory and 162 Raft units, focused metadata/stop RPC and warnings-denied Clippy. Other native targets retain earlier-source qualification. Terminal resumption/removal/slot release remain pending; use current readiness as the prerequisite for FO-04 resource/movement reservations. No measured kernel/container limits, deployed RustFS/Colima, TPS/p99 or soak qualification."
}
